HO KAHA BHAYYA MERE AYE ALI AKBER<br>
<br>
KHETI THI SUGHRA YAHI HAR GHADI ROKAR<br>
<br>
Kaisi Aafat Aayi Hai Baap Hai Na Bhai Hai<br>
Mai Watan Me Hu Magar Aalam-e-Tanhayi Hai<br>
Bin Tumhare Hogaya Suna Suna Ghar<br>
<br>
Zindagi Mujhko Hai Bar Dil Hai Mera Be-Qarar<br>
Ek Qayamat Ban Gaya Ab Ye Tera Intezar<br>
Chalta Hai Qanjar Mere Dil Pe Reh-RehKar<br>
<br>
Tune Wada Tha Kiya Tujhko Lene Aaunga<br>
Raat Din Ankhon Me Bas Rheta Hai Chera Tera<br>
Kab Tu Aqir Aayega Shabi-e-Payghambar<br>
<br>
Kab Se Mai Bimar Hu Jeene Se Bezarn Hu<br>
Kab Se Mai Bhayya Teri Talab-e-Deedar Hu<br>
Hai Tamanna Dekhlu Tujhko Jeebhar Kar<br>
<br>
Jhule Wala Na-Tawan Mera Bhai Be-Qarar<br>
Dil Tadapta Hai Mera Usko Dhundhu Mai Kaha<br>
Yaad Aata Hai Bahut Wo Mera Asghar<br>
<br>
Tha Yahi Sughra Ka Kaam Leke Bas Akber Ka Naam<br>
Kheti Thi Ahsan Yahi Dekhti Hu Subh-o-Shaam<br>
Tere Qadmoun Ke Nashan Hai Jo Mithi Par